## Security Rules (Always Apply)

> Full details in `.claude/rules/security.md`

### Secrets & Credentials
- ❌ **NEVER** hardcode: API keys, passwords, tokens, credentials
- ✅ **ALWAYS** use: Environment variables, secrets managers

### PII (Personally Identifiable Information)
- ❌ **NEVER** log: Email, phone, SSN, IP addresses
- ✅ **ALWAYS**: Redact before logging, tokenize before LLM processing

